== Trivia ==
* The name '''Detective Amog''' is likely a reference to the murder mystery game "[[w:Among Us|Among Us]]".
* Visually, he is based on the character [[w:Rorschach (character)|Rorschach]] from [[w:DC Comics|DC Comics]].
* The quest for the {{Item|Ring of Broken Love}} is in reference to the {{Item|Ring of Love}} from the [[Romero and Juliette]] quest.

