'''Goons''' are [[NPC]]s present in the Hub while {{NPCSprite|Candidate Aura;Aura}} or {{NPCSprite|Dante}} is in office.

Punching a '''Goon''' while {{NPCSprite|Candidate Aura;Aura}} is [[Mayor Election|Mayor]] sends the player to the {{Zone|Prison of the Bereft}}.

Preceding [[The Uprising]], they were meant to protect [[Official Buildings]] and only let the player pass if they were wearing a {{Item|Happy Mask}} or had a {{Item|Dante's Talisman}} in their inventory. If the player had less than {{Green|8}} hours of playtime, '''Goons''' would not prevent them from entering [[Official Buildings]].

Other '''Goon''' variants, such as the {{NPCSprite|Corrupt Goon}}, {{NPCSprite|Guard Goon}} and {{NPCSprite|Electoral Goon}}, do not jail the player when attacked.

