== Trivia ==
*Once the '''Lone Adventurer'''<nowiki>'</nowiki>s [[Quest]] has been completed, {{Rmt|&9Dragon Specialist}} will be displayed over their head.
*The '''Lone Adventurer''' begins with [[Ender Armor]], before moving on to [[Young Dragon Armor]] and finally [[Superior Dragon Armor]].
**Whilst in [[Young Dragon Armor]] the '''Lone Adventurer''' can be seen with their {{Lv|46}} {{Legendary}} [[Enderman Pet]]. They will change to having an [[Ender Dragon Pet]] when in [[Superior Dragon Armor]].
*Despite their name, the '''Lone Adventurer''' seeks help from the player.

