== Trivia ==
*'''Moby'''{{'}} name could be a reference to the sperm whale [[w:Moby Dick (whale)|''Moby Dick'']] from Herman Melville's novel [[w:Moby-Dick|''Moby-Dick'']].
**Another item referencing this book is {{Item|Moby-Duck}}.
*'''Moby'''{{'}}s skin could potentially be a reference to a similar skin made for the player ''GeorgeNotFound'' on the web series ''Dream SMP''.

